\description{
Play-by-play of one match: goals, penalties, goalie changes and timeouts, one row per event.

Wraps \verb{GET https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/den.hokejovyzapis.cz/matches/\{match_id\}/period-events.json} of the Metal Ligaen eSports bucket. Example: \url{https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/den.hokejovyzapis.cz/matches/575/period-events.json}.
Seasons are END years (2027 = 2026/27); every request waits at least one second after
the last one to the same host.
}
